text: |-
  Dear Camelot Jack,
  This notice responds to your Utah
  Government Records Access and
  Management Act (GRAMA) request dated
  November 1, 2025, seeking:
  "All surveillance video footage (including raw,
  unedited files in their highest available reso-
  lution) captured by any and all security cam-
  eras located at or near the Pedestrian Tunnel
  under Campus Drive (connecting off-campus
  housing areas such as The Green on Campus
  Drive to central campus facilities) on
  September 10, 2025, from 12:00 PM MDT to
  6:00 PM MDT. This includes footage from
  entry/exit points of the tunnel, adjacent path-
  ways, and any overlapping campus security
  cameras that may capture activity in this
  area.
  Any associated metadata, timestamps, or logs
  related to the above footage, including cam-
  era activation records, motion detection
  alerts, or export histories for the specified
  date and time range."
  The request is denied under the following
  GRAMA provisions:
